094 gemma4-moe-triton-config: tuned M=1 Triton MoE config for the Gemma 4 MoE int4 w4a16 shape on RTX 3090

gemma4 (26B) and gemma4-21b-reap share the routed-expert shape (E=128, hidden 2816, per-rank
intermediate 352, group 32, zero points, top-8, gated gelu) and ran fused_moe_kernel_gptq_awq on the
upstream default config. Only the "1" key is tuned; M >= 2 keeps the upstream default values.
up: BLOCK_N 16 / BLOCK_K 64 / 1 warp / 2 stages; down: BLOCK_N 16 / BLOCK_K 32 / 2 warps / 4 stages.
Microbench 211 -> 107 us per fused_moe call.
Tripwire at 1K / 32K / 262K, interleaved boots:
  gemma4          101.9 / 97.0 / 72.1 and 102.4 / 97.1 / 71.7 -> 148.6 / 137.6 / 91.1 and 148.6 / 137.0 / 91.1
  gemma4-21b-reap 101.6 / 98.4 / 83.2 and 101.9 / 98.9 / 83.7 -> 147.1 / 140.6 / 111.0 and 147.5 / 140.6 / 111.2
Gate at parity on both (MMLU-57, HumanEval-30, natural-haystack needle grid 131K-229K).
